Merge conflicts arose between the book search/add feature branch and master's history/auth event functionality. Three files had conflicting dependency injection and navigation setup.

**Resolved conflicts:**

- **AppModule.kt**: Merged repository and use case providers
  - Retained Aladin book search and backend repositories
  - Added history and auth event repositories from master

- **RemoteModule.kt**: Combined service and data source providers
  - Preserved Aladin book service and backend API service
  - Integrated history service and user service from master

- **MainActivity.kt**: Unified navigation and lifecycle setup
  - Kept SearchBookViewModel initialization for book search screens
  - Added AuthEvent LaunchedEffect for login redirection flow

```kotlin
// MainActivity now includes both features
val searchBookViewModel: SearchBookViewModel = hiltViewModel()

LaunchedEffect(Unit) {
    getAuthEventUseCase()
        .onEach {
            when (it) {
                DomainAuthEvent.LOGIN_REQUIRED -> {
                    navController.navigate(LOGIN_ROUTE) {
                        popUpTo(MAIN_ROUTE) { inclusive = true }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        .launchIn(this)
}
```

All dependency providers now coexist without duplication or omission.

